  "details": "Currently the friction point on mobile lies within how brand new players are not re-directed to an event when joining from a link to the instance displayed at the IRL venue.\n\nInstead they are presented the main dashboard immediately after Account Creation.\n\nIdeally, once their account is created it would then re-direct them to the instance that they initially tapped on.\n\nSteps laid out as bullets:\n\n- Attendee taps or scans instance link.,,\n\n- Presented with sign up process.,,\n\n- Skip dashboard and re-direct to instance link ID.\n\nWould be interested to see what other Creators or Live Events Hosts thoughts are on the matter. :)",
